title Riverglades 1: Southern Watch, the farms and Farholde Keep (experimental)
faction Alliance
levels 37-40
zone Riverglades
coords live
folder Riverglades · Experimental
why Forever's new zone, an alpha route written from players' recordings.
keywords riverglades, farholde, wheeler's grange, turner's logging camp, experimental, alpha
next polestar-experimental/riverglades-alliance-2

# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Alliance, part 1 of 2 (2026-11-11). Hand-written.
# Every quest, NPC and spot comes from players' recordings of the zone (6-9 people per quest on this leg), with
# Forever's quest data (the client's quest records and QuestieDB 1.0.14) for titles, levels and objectives.
# Order: the way in from Redridge, a western loop (Southern Watch, Turner's Logging Camp, the Bristle Hills),
# the river and Wheeler's Grange, Farholde Keep, then the plains up to Terral's Watch.
# Left out on purpose:
# - Snargl's Snout (94679): Snargl is an elite (level 40) in the Bristle Hills: behind a group choice only.
# - The Rog'mar errands from Watcher Cornelius (Preventative Measures 95064, Rog'mar Supplies 95426): they send you
#   into the Horde training grounds beside Rog'mar; most players who took them dropped them.
# - King of the Wild Plains (95986): Ombassa is an elite (level 41).
# - Love Thy Neighbor (95330) and High Stakes (96009): both send you back west to Turner's Logging Camp after
#   Farholde Keep; part 2 picks them up on its way through the camp.
# - The Sharpest of Blades (95184): one recorded hand-in only.

step Into the Riverglades
  when !zone "Riverglades"
  tip Experimental route (alpha). It follows what players did in the Riverglades and may still have rough spots: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Fly to Lakeshire in Redridge, then follow the road north out of town and up through Blackrock Pass: it comes down into the western Riverglades by the Bristle Hills.
  fly "Lakeshire"
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 44.8,8.9 "Blackrock Pass"
  zone Riverglades
  goto 16.0,68.5 "The western Riverglades"

step Scout Bolain
  tip Scout Bolain waits beside the road east of the pass.
  accept 95147                          -- The Lost Scout

step Southern Watch
  tip Follow the road east to Southern Watch, the Alliance outpost above the river.
  turnin 95147                          -- Cedric Dalton
  accept 94678                          -- Gnoll Infestation
  accept 95148                          -- Southern Watch Gnoll Report: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep, keep it

step Turner's Logging Camp
  tip North up the road to the lumber camp. Halligan Turner runs it.
  accept 94842                          -- Unsavory Plant Food
  accept 94843                          -- From Seed to Sprout
  accept 94931                          -- Stolen Saws

step Saplings
  tip Use Halligan's Tree Sprouting Kit on bare ground around the camp: five saplings.
  use 266161 quest 94843.1 @38.3,62.8   -- Tree Sprouting Kit

step The Bristle Hills
  tip West into the Bristle Hills: the Redridge gnolls camp along the slopes on both sides of the road you came in on. The saw blades lie in their camps.
  kill 255770 x8 quest 94678.1          -- Redridge Mystic
  kill 255772 x8 quest 94678.2          -- Redridge Trapper
  kill 255769 x6 quest 94678.3          -- Redridge Brute
  collect 266897 x8 quest 94931.1 @18.6,70.5  -- Saw Blade

step Snargl
  when group 94679
  tip Snargl is an elite gnoll (level 40) in the south-western camp of the Bristle Hills: grouping up is advised.
  accept 94679                          -- Cedric Dalton, Southern Watch
  collect 265357 quest 94679.1 @16.1,73.2  -- Snargl's Snout
  turnin 94679

step Turner's Logging Camp
  turnin 94931                          -- Halligan Turner
  turnin 94843

step Holmsby farm
  tip South down the road past Southern Watch to the Holmsbys' farm by the river.
  accept 94999                          -- Eleanor Holmsby: Eyes for the Watchman
  accept 94923                          -- Robbie Holmsby: Hats Off

step Southern Watch
  turnin 94678                          -- Cedric Dalton
  turnin 94999                          -- Watcher Fredericks, a few steps west @36.4,75.8

step Wheeler's Grange
  tip East along the river road to Wheeler's Grange: Benjy Wheeler stands by the farmhouse.
  accept 94614                          -- Freshwater Fiends

step The river, south
  tip South-west from Wheeler's Grange to the river. The Mudfin murlocs line both banks (they also drop the heads for Halligan); Robbie's hat lies on the bank among them; the fresh manure is in the fields by Meadowsbrook, west of the river.
  kill 258574 x8 quest 94614.1 @50.1,79.4  -- Mudfin Warrior
  kill 258573 x8 quest 94614.2          -- Mudfin Oracle
  collect 266884 quest 94923.1 @49.3,78.7  -- Robbie's Hat
  collect 266156 x4 quest 94842.2 @45.4,80.0  -- Fresh Manure

step Holmsby farm
  turnin 94923                          -- Robbie Holmsby

step The river, north
  tip North up the river towards Turner's Logging Camp: the Jumbo Crawfish keep to the shallows, and the murlocs further up give the rest of the heads.
  collect 266157 x4 quest 94842.1 @46.0,67.7  -- Jumbo Crawfish Shell
  collect 267266 x8 quest 94842.3 @44.6,60.5  -- Mudfin Murloc Head

step Turner's Logging Camp
  turnin 94842                          -- Halligan Turner

step Wheeler's Grange
  tip Back east to Wheeler's Grange.
  turnin 94614                          -- Benjy Wheeler

step Farholde Keep
  tip Keep east along the road to Farholde Keep. Gretchen Mayberry, the gryphon master, stands at its western gate: talk to her to learn the flight path. The inn is inside the walls to the south.
  talk 257087                           -- Gretchen Mayberry: learn the Farholde Keep flight path
  turnin 95148                          -- Demar Brant, in the keep
  accept 94613                          -- My Kingdom for a Horse
  accept 95329                          -- Out in the Field
  accept 94877                          -- Saving Sunnyglade: for part 2
  accept 94881                          -- Ashe Amberhall: Curious Trinkets, for part 2
  accept 94879                          -- Scraps of Knowledge, for part 2
  accept 95156                          -- Ember Bladewhisper: Stuff 'Em and Stick 'Em
  accept 95943                          -- Bertrand Ironbrow: Foreman's Plight

step The cathedral
  tip Sister Rowland keeps the old cathedral at the south-west corner of Farholde Keep. The bats roost in its upper floor; Marla Bell hands out the holy candles beside it; the graves are in the chapel graveyard.
  accept 95603                          -- Bats in the Belfry
  kill 262037 x5 quest 95603.1          -- Roosting Duskbat
  turnin 95603
  accept 95613                          -- Keeping the Light On
  collect 17028 x5 quest 95613.1 @62.2,86.0  -- Holy Candle, from Marla Bell
  turnin 95613
  accept 95615                          -- In Memoriam
  use 269997 quest 95615.1 @61.9,83.8   -- Bundle of Candles, on the graves
  turnin 95615

step Tessa Dawnbright
  tip Tessa Dawnbright stands south-west of the keep, by the orchard: the apples hang on the trees around it.
  accept 95561                          -- Apple of My Eye
  collect 271431 x6 quest 95561.1 @61.9,83.7  -- Fresh Apple
  turnin 95561
  accept 95913                          -- Fit for a Princess

step Wheeler's Grange
  tip West to Wheeler's Grange.
  turnin 94613                          -- Benjy Wheeler
  accept 94615                          -- Foal Play

step The stables
  tip Search around the stables south of the farmhouse for the horses' tracks.
  collect 267223 quest 94615.1 @54.6,78.0  -- Pawprint Tracing
  collect 268536 x3 quest 95156.1 @54.7,75.3  -- Bundle of Hay, around the farm

step Benjy Wheeler
  turnin 94615
  accept 94617                          -- Coyote Huntin'
  accept 94618                          -- Wheeler's Fleeing Steeds

step The coyote den
  tip The coyotes den in the hills south of the farm: Sootfur, the big dark one, sits at the back of it; the Plains Coyotes around it drop the pelts.
  collect 271432 x3 quest 95913.1 @54.6,83.2  -- Coyote Pelt
  collect 265738 quest 94617.1 @54.3,85.7  -- Sootfur's Pelt

step The lost horse
  tip One of Benjy's horses ran north up the river, past the farm. Give it the feed, then lead it home.
  turnin 94618 @53.7,66.3               -- Lost Horse
  accept 94992 @53.7,66.3               -- Rescue Roundup
  complete 94992 @54.9,73.0             -- walk it back to Wheeler's Grange

step Benjy Wheeler
  turnin 94992
  turnin 94617

step Foreman's Crate
  tip North up the track towards Terral's Watch: the foreman's crate lies by the road.
  collect 271620 quest 95943.1 @51.2,57.2  -- Foreman's Crate

step Terral's Watch
  tip Watcher Cornelius holds Terral's Watch, the tower on the plains north-east of the crate.
  turnin 95329                          -- Watcher Cornelius
  accept 94924                          -- Hunting the Hunters
  accept 94925                          -- A Fur Trade

step The plains
  tip The Rog'mar Poachers hunt the plains north of the tower; the Wildplains lions roam among them. A picked carcass lies in the grass east of the tower: its skull starts A Feast for Buzzards.
  accept 95983 @61.7,58.8               -- Picked Carcass: A Feast for Buzzards
  kill 259052 x12 quest 94924.1         -- Rog'mar Poacher
  collect 266888 x8 quest 94925.1 @59.8,53.7  -- Prized Lion Hide

step Terral's Watch
  turnin 94924                          -- Watcher Cornelius
  turnin 94925
  accept 94928                          -- A Few Furs for Friz: for Powderfuse Port, keep it
  turnin 95983
  accept 95984                          -- Song of the Strider

step Tallstriders
  tip The Roving Tallstriders graze the plains east of the tower, towards the coast.
  collect 271778 quest 95984.1 @67.3,53.9  -- Intact Tallstrider Beak

step Terral's Watch
  turnin 95984                          -- Watcher Cornelius

step Farholde Keep
  tip South back to Farholde Keep.
  turnin 95156                          -- Ember Bladewhisper
  turnin 95943                          -- Bertrand Ironbrow
  turnin 95913                          -- Tessa Dawnbright
  accept 95961                          -- Stepped Out: for Gray Dawnbright in Powderfuse Port, keep it
